# Agent roles

Orga Drone uses three specialized project subagents under `.cursor/agents/`.
The main agent remains the implementer.

| Role | Subagent | Use when |
|------|----------|----------|
| Product-Spec-Reviewer | `product-spec-reviewer` | Review an existing product spec vs code/docs; no code changes |
| Engineering-Planner | `engineering-planner` | Approved spec → technical plan; research first (Plan Mode) |
| Implementation-Reviewer | `implementation-reviewer` | Review diff/tests/docs/risks before commit |

Workflow:

1. Spec written (human / product)
2. Product-Spec-Reviewer → approve / revise
3. Engineering-Planner → plan
4. Main agent → implement
5. Implementation-Reviewer → pre-commit review
6. Commit only when the user explicitly asks

Delegate to these subagents when the user names the role or the task clearly matches. Do not skip Product-Spec-Reviewer for large product claims unless the user waives it.
